    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n55077" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταρτ-ισμός</span></b> , ὁ,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>restoration,
			reconciliation</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Sm.
				<u>Is.</u>
				38.12
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<u>Settling</u> of a limb, <i><span class="en">
				Heliod.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				49.1.1
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				1.73
			</span></i> (pl.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>furnishing, preparation</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐλῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PTeb.</u>
					33.12
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(ii B.C.)</span>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱματίον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PRyl.</u>
					127.28
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(i A.D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			<i>training, discipline</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν ἁγίων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ep.Eph.</u>
					4.12
				</span></i>
			.</div>
